## CardManiacs support

CardManiacs is a focused reading app for macOS and iOS — RSS feeds, read-later, highlights, and PDF/EPUB documents in one calm library, synced through your iCloud account when enabled.

## System requirements

- **macOS:** macOS 26 or later (Apple Silicon)
- **iOS / iPadOS:** iOS 26 or later (where available)

## Getting help

- **Email:** [support@cardmaniacs.app](mailto:support@cardmaniacs.app)
- **Documentation:** [cardmaniacs.app/docs](https://cardmaniacs.app/docs)

We typically respond within a few business days.

## Subscriptions (CardManiacs Pro)

CardManiacs Pro is an auto-renewable subscription billed through your Apple ID. Manage or cancel anytime in **System Settings → Apple Account → Subscriptions** (macOS) or **Settings → Subscriptions** (iOS).

To restore a purchase, open CardManiacs → **Settings → Subscription** and tap **Restore Purchases** on the paywall.

## Privacy

See our [Privacy Policy](/privacy) for how we handle analytics, diagnostics, purchases, and iCloud sync.

## Press

Press inquiries: [press@cardmaniacs.app](mailto:press@cardmaniacs.app).
